.RE
.TP
.B clear [<options>] [<file(s)>]
take the answers back out
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-stdout
print the result instead of writing the file
.TP
.B \-\-quiet
report only failures
.TP
.B \-\-yes
do not ask before emptying every chapter
.RE
.TP
.B publish [<options>]
